===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|goh|sibunzehan}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*sebuntehun}}. Compare {{cog|nl|zeventien}}, {{cog|fy|santjin}}, {{cog|en|seventeen}}, {{cog|da|sytten}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈziːp.tseːn/|/ˈzɪp-/|/-tsɛn/|/-tsən/}}
* The short-vowel variants are de-facto standard and only minimally informal. The form in reduced {{IPAchar|/ən/}} is mainly heard in eastern Germany.
